      "category": "Text",
      "text": "4. Whenever the Board of Estimate had exempted matters from public letting chargeable to capital funds, no further approval by the Mayor is required of the expenditure notwithstanding the requirements included in the certificate of the Mayor certifying the amounts of obligations to be used for financing the involved capital project. The resolution adopted by the Board of Estimate should include the code and project to which the work is chargeable.",
