      "category": "Text",
      "text": "5. In pursuance of Section 3 of the New York City Charter the Director of the Budget is hereby authorized, empowered and directed, within his discretion to approve of expenditures chargeable to special funds or chargeable against unencumbered balances of appropriations of capital funds authorized prior to January 1, 1963, and to transfer funds within accounts thereof within the related capital project and the Comptroller is authorized and empowered to make such transfer.",
